            "review_title": "Review at Cơm Tấm Trống Đồng",
            "review_text": "Solotraveller78\nGlasgow, United Kingdom616 contributions\n0\nGreat food, cheap price. Highly recommend\nApr 2023 • Solo\nI visited Nha trang for the first time in April, travelling solo and was recommended this place by a fellow traveller. It is a cafe style establishment with open kitchen which allows you to pick your food and see it being made. I visited 4 days in a row and always opted for the ribs with rice, salad and kimchi. Generous portions and the food is delicious. \nThe staff are friendly and welcoming, fans above every table, clean and well maintained toilets. Cannot fault this place tbh.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 1, 2023",
